      en: ["Completed in 1962 at a cost of $20 million.", "Total length is 1,654 meters with a main span of 344 meters.", "Clearance under the bridge is 61 meters at high tide.", "Unites North and South America via the Pan-American Highway.", "Was originally known as Thatcher Ferry Bridge.", "Features a distinctive arched truss design.", "Carries approximately 35,000 vehicles per day.", "One of the most photographed structures in Panama."],
